<title>AUSTRIA: Saudi production capacity 10.3 mln bpd - Saudi source.</title>
<headline>Saudi production capacity 10.3 mln bpd - Saudi source.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Saudi source said Saudi Arabian production capacity is at 10.3 million barrels per day and will continue in this way.</p>
<p>The source said Saudi Arabia and its OPEC Gulf allies Kuwait and the UAE will continue to abide by their OPEC production quotas.</p>
<p>&quot;We are sticking to our quota and we will be really sticking to this quota,&quot; the Saudi source said.</p>
<p>The source denied that the U.S. or any other government could influence Saudi Arabian oil production policy.</p>
<p>&quot;Saudi Arabia follows its own interests and no one else's interests,&quot; the source said.</p>
</text>
